Package: kylin-system-tools
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6), python3-pyqt5
Maintainer: Kylin Team <support@kylin.com>
Description: 银河麒麟运维管理工具
 A comprehensive system administration and maintenance tool for
 Kylin Linux Desktop V10 SP1, providing system information monitoring,
 service management, network configuration, user management,
 software management, log cleanup, and security settings.
 .
 Features:
  - System information and status monitoring
  - Service management
  - Network configuration
  - User management
  - Software package management
  - Log management and cleanup
  - Kysec security center control
  - Command terminal
